{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1141958-would-a-bsd-do-this","id":1141958,"title":"Would a BSD do this?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-19T18:00:49-07:00","id":1141958,"title":"Would a BSD do this?","content":"I came up with a villain for a campaign set in the 50s. He is basically a BSD who is secretly the head of a group of teenaged greasers. This BSD, whose is called &quot;Pop&quot; by the greasers, encourages the boys to do crimes across town like boosting car parts in exchange for money and favors. The BSD's goal is to spread taint through corrupting the greasers, which may cause them to start spreading it to others in their school. My question is, would a BSD do this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T04:33:43-07:00","id":1142097,"title":"","content":"It sounds like something the BSD's would do.<br /> <br /> was about to say that BSD's get their name from the first set of things they say after dancing....<br /> <br /> but then noted you said called &quot;Pop&quot; 'by the greasers'<br /> <br /> sounds believable enough contributing to human misery, though more likely as a hobby, then as a job.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T11:08:48-07:00","id":1142227,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the input. I wonder what kind of favors would a BSD be able to Grant? I should also figure out why he is called Pop.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T11:45:18-07:00","id":1142242,"title":"","content":"best reason to call him pop, is because they saw him as a father figure... as for ideas?<br /> <br /> maybe money, maybe discounts from pentex.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T12:17:30-07:00","id":1142253,"title":"","content":"Yeah, my original idea was to make Pop a father figure to them. A BSD father-figure, that sounds like a recipe for disaster. Especially if he decides to have his &quot;boys&quot; walk the Spiral, if that's possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T21:40:01-07:00","id":1142411,"title":"","content":"The idea of this gives me a few plot ideas I can share!<br /> 1: Pops is theurge, one of glasswalker talents. He runs a garage and uses the finest of wyrmish products. The boys help cause so mayhem so customers come to his shop. There is a point though where his boys might catch on, maybe want some more! A little Bane goes a long way for someone becoming a fomori.<br /> 2. Similar song and dance as above, Pops runs a diner and the boys act as his 'security' and enforcers in town when someone tries to compete. All his food is corrupted but everyone just LOVES the burgers!<br /> 3.Pops runs a 'after school' program, teaches wayward kids 'talents' but only kids and young teens are allowed to know what the old man shows them. He might be teaching them hedge magic, letting them get infested with banes, telling them how to kill the real monsters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T09:52:37-07:00","id":1142569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1141958-would-a-bsd-do-this?p=1142242#post1142242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">maybe discounts from pentex.</div> </div> </div> </div>Somehow, I can't quite picture teens turning into delinquents for &quot;discounts&quot;. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13562-lordmagnusen","name":"lordmagnusen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T16:32:28-07:00","id":1142740,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1141958-would-a-bsd-do-this?p=1142227#post1142227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for the input. I wonder what kind of favors would a BSD be able to Grant? I should also figure out why he is called Pop.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, going by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Cage_(TV_series)\" target=\"_blank\">another character of the same name</a>: For the sound of his knuckles when they hit someone. Of course, most people think the name only refers to his status as a surrogate father.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3118-cifer","name":"Cifer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3118_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-16T20:59:16-08:00","id":1176685,"title":"","content":"I love the idea of low level corruption instead of going straight for the murderizing<br /> <br /> Book of the Wyrm has a few things that might come in handy for &quot;Pop&quot;<br /> <br /> - Free Gas - Endron Unleaded; maybe also prototype engine for their hot rod that has a bane in the engine (like the Falcon Pathfinder rules)<br /> - Beer (Blue Stripe) and Whiskey (Woody Creek) he could give it to the under 21s, (since they can't get it legally, depending on laws in that state in the 50s) they could sell them to other teens. <br /> (I'm imagining a combination of the movie Crybaby and the foot clan from the first TMNT Movie)<br /> - Maybe Black Dog Games started off with Ouiji boards and the &quot;Devil's music&quot; of Rock 'n Roll to influence and taint the youth. (Black Dog record Label? &quot;Black Dog&quot; as a music producer?)<br /> <br /> The 50s are the start of environmental activism (Which Pop could get the greasers to fight) and the start of Nuclear reactors (Starting in the Soviet areas) which you could get the kids to try and fight for, get their parents behind to help with underemployment in their town (and pollution increasing)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16927-illithid","name":"Illithid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16927_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-19T15:23:31-08:00","id":1177435,"title":"","content":"for the most part, gaian garou would be a lot closer to the average spiral if they didn't inflate themselves with noble goals. Spirals are really convincing villains if they act more in a fucked up family situation- They love and are very protective over their family, but as powerful beings they feel they're entitled to more (more wives, more children, servants) I think the BSD in your case would be a lot more convincing if he had attachment to his people, as opposed to -spreading the wyrm for the wyrm-. Some spirals of course go above and beyond in religious fevour, but most think they've won and'll take the safe rout to damnation. If he felt spreading the wyrm in these kids was good for his own interests, by all means, but spirals are typically themselves before they're for the wyrm, the metis are there for disposable shock troops, the homids can just chill.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Be correct.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23728-pewpew","name":"PewPew","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-18T14:05:36-08:00","id":1187347,"title":"","content":"Given how insane BSD tend to be, pretty much anything you would have typed would be something I agree with. Sounds good btw. Kind of a 50s greaser version of Oliver <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/982-cptmachine","name":"Cptmachine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar982_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}